# The daemon's charging gate: everything else green (creds, pending, wifi) but NOT charging
# -> zero engine calls for the whole bounded run. (Fake empty /sys/class/power_supply.)
desc syncd: not charging -> no engine call ever
invoke syncd
timeout 6
charging off
config paired
wifi up
pending Roms/GBA/Zelda.gba
expect_timeout
expect_log romm-syncd started
expect_trace_absent ENGINE
